# Fishcommerce — UI Mockup Generation Prompts

Copy-paste these prompts into any AI image generator (Midjourney, DALL-E 3, Ideogram, Gemini, etc.) to get pixel-accurate mockups of every page.

> [!TIP]
> For best results, add `--ar 16:9` (Midjourney) or specify **1440×900 desktop viewport** in your generator. For mobile versions, request **390×844**.

---

## 1. Homepage / Hero Section

```
A stunning modern e-commerce landing page for "Fishcommerce" — a premium pet fish store.

Desktop viewport (1440x900).

NAVBAR: Sticky white bar at top with subtle bottom border. Left: "Fishcommerce" logo text in deep violet (#3C1E5E, bold 700 weight). Center: navigation links "Home", "Catalog", "Care Basics", "About Us" in muted gray-purple (#6B6578). Right: shopping cart icon with a small purple badge showing "0", and a "Login" text button in vibrant purple (#6F3FF5).

HERO SECTION: Full-width section with a beautiful radial gradient background fading from soft lavender (#E4D5F9) at the top center to light page white (#F9F6FE) at edges and bottom. 

Left side content:
- Large bold headline: "Bring Vibrant Aquatic Life to Your Home" in deep violet (#3C1E5E), 48px, weight 700, Plus Jakarta Sans font.
- Subtitle below: "Explore healthy, hand-raised pet fish delivered directly to your doorstep with expert care support." in muted gray-purple (#6B6578), 18px, weight 400.
- Two CTA buttons side by side:
  - Primary: "Explore Catalog" — solid vibrant purple (#6F3FF5) background, white text, rounded 12px, subtle shadow.
  - Secondary: "Learn Care Basics" — white background, subtle gray border (#EFEAEF), deep violet text, rounded 12px.

Right side: A floating white card container (#FFFFFF, border-radius 16px, soft purple-tinted shadow) showing an interactive aquarium tank preview. Inside the card: a beautiful purple Betta fish swimming in a softly lit aquatic environment with gentle water effects and depth layers. The card should look like a premium product showcase with subtle glowing highlights.

TRUST STRIP: At the bottom of the hero, a horizontal row of 5 minimalist grayscale partner logos (e.g., "Aquatic Standards Certified", "LiveAquaria Partner", "FishLore Recommended") on the light background, small and subtle.

Clean, premium, modern SaaS-style design. crisp typography. No clutter. Luxurious whitespace. Polished and professional.
```

---

## 2. Product Catalog Page

```
A modern e-commerce product catalog page for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: light (#F9F6FE).

NAVBAR: Same sticky white navbar as homepage — "Fishcommerce" logo left (deep violet #3C1E5E bold), nav links center, cart icon + login button right.

PAGE HEADER: Clean section with page title "Available Pet Fish" in deep violet (#3C1E5E, bold, 32px) on the left, and a search bar on the right (white background, rounded, subtle border #EFEAEF, search icon, placeholder text "Search fish...").

FILTER BAR: Horizontal row of pill-shaped toggle buttons below the header.
- Category group: "All" (active — filled purple #6F3FF5, white text), "Freshwater" (inactive — white bg, gray border, dark text), "Saltwater" (inactive).
- Care Level group: "All" (active), "Beginner Friendly", "Intermediate", "Expert" — same pill style.

PRODUCT GRID: 4-column responsive grid of product cards, showing 8 fish cards total (2 rows of 4).

Each PRODUCT CARD:
- White background (#FFFFFF), border-radius 16px, subtle border (#EFEAEF), soft purple-tinted shadow on hover.
- Top: High-quality square photo of a pet fish (different species per card — Betta, Clownfish, Guppy, Angelfish, Neon Tetra, Discus, Goldfish, Arowana).
- Below image: Fish name in deep violet (#3C1E5E, bold, 16px). Example: "Crown Tail Betta".
- Price in vibrant purple (#6F3FF5, bold): "$24.99"
- A row of small pill badges: "Beginner" (light lavender bg, purple text), "Peaceful" (same style), "Freshwater".
- "View Details" button at the bottom — purple text (#6F3FF5) with subtle underline or outline style.

Cards should have generous padding, clean spacing. The entire page feels airy, organized, and premium. Plus Jakarta Sans typography throughout.
```

---

## 3. Product Detail Page

```
A product detail page for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store showing a Crown Tail Betta fish.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: light (#F9F6FE).

NAVBAR: Same as other pages.

TWO-COLUMN LAYOUT:

LEFT COLUMN (55% width):
- A large high-resolution hero image of a stunning purple/red Crown Tail Betta fish on a dark aquatic background, displayed in a white card container (border-radius 16px).
- Below: A row of 3 small thumbnail images showing different angles of the fish, with the first one highlighted with a purple border.

RIGHT COLUMN (45% width):
- Fish name: "Crown Tail Betta" in deep violet (#3C1E5E), 36px, bold.
- Price: "$24.99" in vibrant purple (#6F3FF5), 28px, bold.
- Stock badge: "In Stock" — small green pill badge.
- A subtle divider line.

CARE SPECS BOX: A rounded container (border-radius 12px) with a light lavender surface background (#E4D5F9, 30% opacity overlay). Contains a 2-column grid of care specifications:
  - Water Type: Freshwater (with water drop icon)
  - Temperament: Peaceful (with peace icon)
  - Care Level: Beginner (with star icon)
  - Min Tank Size: 5 Gallons (with tank icon)
  - Diet: Flakes & Pellets (with food icon)
Each spec has a small muted label and a bold value in deep violet.

DESCRIPTION: A paragraph of text in muted gray-purple (#6B6578) describing the fish's behavior, origin, and co-habitation recommendations.

CTA BUTTON: Full-width "Adopt / Order Now" button — solid vibrant purple (#6F3FF5), white text, large, rounded 12px, bold. Prominent and inviting.

Clean, premium layout. Plenty of whitespace. Plus Jakarta Sans font.
```

