## 4. Checkout Page

```
A checkout page for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: light (#F9F6FE).

NAVBAR: Same as other pages, cart icon now shows "2" in the badge.

TWO-COLUMN LAYOUT:

LEFT COLUMN (60% width) — Order Information Form inside a white card (border-radius 16px, subtle border):
- Section header: "Customer Details" in deep violet (#3C1E5E, bold, 20px).
- Form fields with labels in muted gray-purple, inputs with white bg, rounded corners, subtle border:
  - Full Name
  - Phone Number
  - Email Address
- Section header: "Delivery Address"
- Form fields:
  - Street Address
  - City
  - Postal Code
  - Tank Setup / Special Delivery Notes (textarea, taller)
- All inputs are clean, well-spaced, with soft focus states (purple border on focus).

RIGHT COLUMN (40% width) — Order Summary Card:
- White card (border-radius 16px, subtle border).
- Header: "Order Summary" in deep violet bold.
- Item list:
  - Row 1: Small fish thumbnail, "Crown Tail Betta × 1" — $24.99
  - Row 2: Small fish thumbnail, "Neon Tetra × 3" — $11.97
- Divider line.
- Subtotal: $36.96
- Shipping: $5.99
- Divider line.
- Total: "$42.95" in vibrant purple, bold, 24px.
- Large CTA button: "Confirm & Place Order" — full-width, solid purple (#6F3FF5), white text, rounded 12px.

Clean, organized, trustworthy checkout experience. Plus Jakarta Sans font. Premium feel.
```

