## 5. Order Success / Confirmation Page

```
An order confirmation page for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: soft radial gradient from lavender (#E4D5F9) at center to light (#F9F6FE) at edges — celebratory feel.

NAVBAR: Same as other pages.

CENTERED CONTENT: A single white card (#FFFFFF, border-radius 20px, generous padding, soft purple shadow) in the center of the page, max-width 600px.

Inside the card:
- Top: A large animated-looking lavender/purple checkmark icon inside a soft lavender circle — feels celebratory and premium.
- Heading: "Order Confirmed!" in deep violet (#3C1E5E), 32px, bold.
- Order reference: "Order #FC-20261102-A7K3" in muted gray-purple, 16px, with a small copy icon.

- A subtle divider.

- Items ordered summary:
  - "Crown Tail Betta × 1"
  - "Neon Tetra × 3"
  - "Total: $42.95" in purple bold.

- Contact details: "john@example.com | +91 9876543210"

- A lavender-tinted status banner (light #E4D5F9 background, purple left border, rounded):
  "Your order request has been received! Our team will contact you shortly to confirm delivery schedules and water acclimation instructions."

- Bottom: A "Continue Shopping" link button in purple (#6F3FF5).

Warm, reassuring, premium feel. Plus Jakarta Sans font. Clean whitespace.
```

