## 6. Login / Sign Up Page

```
A login and signup page for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: soft radial gradient from lavender (#E4D5F9) at top to light (#F9F6FE).

CENTERED CARD: White card (#FFFFFF, border-radius 20px, max-width 440px, soft shadow) in the center.

TOP OF CARD: "Fishcommerce" logo text in deep violet, centered. Below it: a tab toggle with two options — "Sign In" (active, purple underline) and "Create Account" (inactive, gray text).

SIGN IN FORM (active state shown):
- "Email Address" input field — white bg, rounded, subtle border, placeholder text.
- "Password" input field — same style, with eye icon to toggle visibility.
- "Sign In" button — full-width, solid purple (#6F3FF5), white text, rounded 12px, bold.
- Divider with "or" text in the center.
- "Continue as Guest" button — full-width, white bg, subtle gray border (#EFEAEF), deep violet text.
- Small text at bottom: "Don't have an account? Create one" as a link.

Clean, minimal, trustworthy. Plus Jakarta Sans font. Purple accent colors throughout.
```

