## 7. Admin — Product Management

```
A premium admin dashboard for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store — Product Management view.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: light (#F9F6FE).

TOP BAR: Deep violet or dark purple-tinted header bar (#3C1E5E) with:
- Left: "Fishcommerce Admin" in white, bold.
- Right: Notification bell icon with red "2" badge, admin avatar circle with "A".

TAB NAVIGATION: Below the top bar, a white tab strip with three tabs:
- "Product Management" (active — purple underline #6F3FF5, bold text)
- "Pending Orders"
- "Order History"

MAIN CONTENT — white card (rounded 16px, subtle border):
- Header row: "All Products" title on left, "+ Add New Fish" button on right (solid purple #6F3FF5, white text, rounded).

PRODUCT TABLE with columns: Image | Fish Name | Price | Stock | Care Level | Status | Actions
- 6 rows of fish products with:
  - Small square thumbnail images (rounded corners)
  - Fish names in deep violet bold
  - Prices in purple
  - Stock numbers
  - Care level pill badges ("Beginner" green-ish, "Intermediate" amber, "Expert" red-ish)
  - Status toggle switches (green = Available, gray = Unavailable)
  - Action buttons: Edit (blue/purple outline), Delete (red outline, trash icon)

FLOATING MODAL (partially visible/overlay): "Add New Fish" form modal with:
- White card, border-radius 16px, backdrop blur behind
- Fields: Fish Name, Price, Image URL, Water Type dropdown, Temperament dropdown, Care Level dropdown, Min Tank Size, Diet dropdown, Stock Quantity, Description textarea
- "Publish Product" button — solid purple, white text.
- Close X button in top right.

Professional, clean admin UI. Table is well-organized with alternating subtle row backgrounds. Plus Jakarta Sans font.
```

