## 8. Admin — Pending Orders

```
A premium admin dashboard for "Fishcommerce" pet fish store — Pending Orders view.

Desktop viewport (1440x900). Background: light (#F9F6FE).

TOP BAR: Same deep violet bar — "Fishcommerce Admin", bell with "3" badge, admin avatar.

TAB NAVIGATION: "Product Management", "Pending Orders" (active, purple underline), "Order History".

MAIN CONTENT — white card (rounded 16px):
- Header: "Pending Orders" title, with a refresh icon and a small text "3 orders pending".

ORDER TABLE with columns: Order ID | Customer Name | Phone & Email | Fish Ordered | Delivery Address | Order Date | Status | Actions

5 rows with realistic data:
- Order IDs like "FC-2026-A7K3"
- Customer names, phone numbers, email addresses
- Fish ordered: "Crown Tail Betta × 1, Neon Tetra × 3"
- Delivery addresses
- Dates
- Status badges: "Pending" (amber/yellow pill), "Confirmed" (blue pill), "Shipped" (purple pill)
- Action buttons showing contextual next step:
  - For Pending: "Mark as Confirmed" (blue outline button)
  - For Confirmed: "Mark as Shipped" (purple outline button)  
  - For Shipped: "Mark as Delivered" (green outline button)

A toast notification in the top-right: "🔔 New order received!" in a lavender card with purple left border accent, auto-dismiss style.

Clean, professional, data-rich admin table. Readable, well-spaced rows. Plus Jakarta Sans font.
```

